{"4676820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trigger Range", "steam_appid": 4676820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, competitive shooting range game where speed and precision are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through compact, handcrafted levels, eliminate target dummies, and optimize every shot to achieve the perfect run. Every millisecond counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like Track Mania with guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676820/extras/680e38bc34b9805bde777cc504151e16.poster.avif?t=1782373253\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676820/extras/680e38bc34b9805bde777cc504151e16.webm?t=1782373253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676820/extras/680e38bc34b9805bde777cc504151e16.mp4?t=1782373253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This shooting range is used by best shooters from all over the world: Police, SWAT, tactical units, infantry, border guards, Navy SEALs, Delta Force, SAS, GROM, Rangers, security personnel, convoy operators, FBI agents, DEA agents, alien hunters, Wild West bounty hunters, mercenaries, gunslingers, cyberpunk operators, space marines and retired agent still in shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, skill-based gameplay</strong><br>No RNG. Only your speed, aim and reflex matter in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 handcrafted levels</strong><br>Each level features a unique weapon, pace, and playstyle, with its own dedicated leaderboard.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrunning-focused design</strong><br>Optimize routes, minimize mistakes, and shave off milliseconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant reset flow</strong><br>Fail, retry, improve... no downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive leaderboards</strong><br>Climb the rankings and prove your mastery.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, competitive shooting range game where speed and precision are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through compact, handcrafted levels, eliminate target dummies, and optimize every shot to achieve the perfect run. Every millisecond counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like Track Mania with guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676820/extras/680e38bc34b9805bde777cc504151e16.poster.avif?t=1782373253\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676820/extras/680e38bc34b9805bde777cc504151e16.webm?t=1782373253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676820/extras/680e38bc34b9805bde777cc504151e16.mp4?t=1782373253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This shooting range is used by best shooters from all over the world: Police, SWAT, tactical units, infantry, border guards, Navy SEALs, Delta Force, SAS, GROM, Rangers, security personnel, convoy operators, FBI agents, DEA agents, alien hunters, Wild West bounty hunters, mercenaries, gunslingers, cyberpunk operators, space marines 